        "id": 1015428
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-03-22T08:49:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "When you move the creation to table creation time you can make these local variables so that they don\u0027t stay resident in memory forever as static variables.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 499,
        "startChar": 12,
        "endLine": 499,
        "endChar": 18
