        "id": 1015428
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-03-22T08:49:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Little point of English : \"exist\" and \"happen\" can\u0027t be used with \"is\". You say \"does exist\" and \"does happen\".\n\nIn this case, \"doesDeleteTriggerExist\" or \"isDeleteTriggerCreated\" sound good.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 507,
        "startChar": 42,
        "endLine": 507,
        "endChar": 49
      },
      "revId": "c30ced3affcad829da09ddf204797842c13b7399",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
