      "writtenOn": "2019-03-22T08:49:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for thinking of this.\n\nI suggest you move it inside the try {} rather than the finally{}, because this is typically a *very* expensive operation. Maybe even we want to make it part of full maintenance only, rather than every time we want to drop all the expired records.",
