      "message": "This will throw if you don\u0027t have enough records. I think you should simply delete Math.min(number, cursor.getCount()). Better than moveToPosition(), if you have a LIMIT clause you can just say cursor.moveToLast().\n\nIf cursor.getCount() is smaller than number the regular path is not very efficient (you could truncate or something instead), but it\u0027s never supposed to happen anyway.",
